WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,940 --> 00:00:02,840
Why are you crying?

2
00:00:02,900 --> 00:00:06,350
This is a great thing

3
00:00:06,750 --> 00:00:18,100
What does Consultant Li mean?

4
00:00:18,840 --> 00:00:19,800
Something happened in the back mountain

5
00:00:20,120 --> 00:00:21,640
Captain Zhao called your name and asked you to come over immediately.

6
00:00:24,270 --> 00:00:25,470
Just a few days of peace and quiet

7
00:00:26,260 --> 00:00:27,940
What happened again, Consultant Li?

8
00:00:28,340 --> 00:00:29,500
Captain Zhao has something urgent over there

9
00:00:29,500 --> 00:00:36,020
Let you go back to immortality as soon as possible

10
00:00:36,220 --> 00:00:37,420
How about I go back by myself?

11
00:00:37,420 --> 00:00:38,580
You go to the back mountain first

12
00:00:40,370 --> 00:00:42,210
Now the three in your belly are my life
